to view your projects from wherever you are and make decisions when needed.\n\nUse Canibuild to:\n\n\u2022 Explore immersive virtual spaces: Experience your future home through walkable, interactive and dollhouse views.\n\u2022 Collaborate and review: Simplify design reviews with real-time tools built directly into the experience.\n\u2022 Share your experience: Quickly share your space with family, friends and contractors so they can better understand your future home.\n\u2022 Present your space: Connect easily with local and international clients through public or guided viewing sessions.\n\nDiscover a new way to visualize property with Canibuild and change how you experience spaces before they are built.", "short_description": "Know Possibilities Now.\n\nCanibuild takes the guesswork out of designing a space as it brings it to life in a 1:1 VR experience. See all the details and walk through a property before its built helping you make the important decisions in your design."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://canibuild.com/en-us/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://canibuild.com/en-us/terms-conditions/", "publisher_name": "CANIBUILD AU PTY LTD", "support_website_url": "https://canibuild.com/en-au/contact-us/", "website_url": "https://canibuild.com/en-au/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_mode